<title>USA: Dura Pharmaceuticals to offer 4 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Dura Pharmaceuticals to offer 4 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dura Pharmaceuticals Inc Thursday filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of 4.0 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company is selling all of the shares.</p>
</text>
